      "content": "it doesnt help though. even when i'm alone it's not quiet. there's just this constant buzzing in my brain and everything feels so heavy. like i'm just constantly being hit by waves of noise and emotion and i can't catch my breath. i feel like i'm drowning in it. is there even a way to actually make it stop? like, really stop?",
